#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-images-with-mission-planner.rst:5
#: 38c2e9b323844c519fadff976b3b03f5 6cc64a929d0e40bb9d6b0ec2eeecc611
#: 7dee88dccb0a43ddab32d6559aeeba4f d4b6ab2f0e72465fb9442ae3bd951f00
msgid "Geotagging Images with Mission Planner"
msgstr "使用 Mission Planner 进行图像地理标记"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-images-with-mission-planner.rst:7
#: 09aa91126c734cc4a28de44a473a391e 0c238a5718a549cb9f332ce6cf113152
#: 4bb7ffa93f36423291dd723ff9a1af1f a72bbb7504ec46d8b8e7c26c76c5653a
msgid ""
"This article shows how to Geo-tag images, using *Mission Planner* to inject "
"data from telemetry logs into their EXIF tags."
msgstr "本文介绍如何使用 *Mission Planner* 将数传日志数据注入图像 EXIF 标签以进行地理标记。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-images-with-mission-planner.rst:11
#: 4d19f36f089c4c6c9068b8c2a052ec2c 6bf4ca29b8d14e7a9bfe368e059836c5
#: 8a8d84e8d21d403d97d06db212f1ce31 d9ef54958ca54840aa30a6d2ea741513
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-images-with-mission-planner.rst:13
#: 0471eee2288e4efb9fd58b7d1492543c 3458f09079b948248b6c77298ecfac10
#: 65aebe218dda46d79ffc7ea11b8eab43 ebbdb2afaa4944548f856f1e50a71d22
msgid ""
"Geo-tagging images makes it easier to photo-merge the many pictures taken "
"during a :ref:`camera mission <common-camera-control-and-auto-missions-in-"
"mission-planner>`, and is important for applications including "
"photogrammetry, orthophoto generation, 3D terrain modeling etc."
msgstr ""
"图像地理标记使在 :ref:`camera mission <common-camera-control-and-auto-missions-in-"
"mission-planner>` 期间拍摄的大量照片更易于拼接，对于摄影测量、正射影像生成、3D 地形建模等应用非常重要。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-images-with-mission-planner.rst:18
#: 3d802dbb3e6846efb4d58053fddfc1ae 4547ef28141043beb393d3bd23564962
#: 85226237caf74422aaea6c193d9c988d ccf3004ad62c4669bad419ecaab8e8a8
msgid ""
"*Mission Planner* provides two methods for geotagging your photos from a "
"mission log:"
msgstr "*Mission Planner* 提供两种从任务日志对照片进行地理标记的方法："

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-images-with-mission-planner.rst:21
#: 0565c2bd1f6d4e04bec03cc1b1bc78d3 91a6f15de96642578e004683e4674de8
#: 9dcefa2c0ff24157bdba617949c20b1f eb91f9f3a16141f78035f345ff7a76fa
msgid "**CAM messages from dataflash log**"
msgstr "**来自数据闪存日志的 CAM 消息**"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-images-with-mission-planner.rst:23
#: 1c22c57e516747c7a1f0c468e7ee59da 414720214b7048e89847cbbd2f3bae3f
#: 692367497e3146d1ba09302d4c3cf192 7a0188333fc94babbd3fd0f05a52fda4
msgid ""
"ArduPilot can trigger a camera during pre-programmed missions or by RC "
"activation using the ``DO_DIGICAM_CONTROL`` or ``DO_SET_CAM_TRIGG_DIST`` "
"commands. Corresponding CAM messages are stored in the dataflash log, and "
"can be used by Mission Planner to add accurate geotag information to images."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 可以在预编程任务期间或通过遥控激活使用 ``DO_DIGICAM_CONTROL`` 或 "
"``DO_SET_CAM_TRIGG_DIST`` 命令触发相机。相应的 CAM 消息存储在数据闪存日志中，可供 Mission Planner "
"用于向图像添加准确的地理标记信息。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-images-with-mission-planner.rst:28
#: 02e74bf1ad214600a5e3b3bb54235272 1bfb8bcd67a649dda657e3bbc80323ca
#: d59cc7e58ba54bdeb54c931b42b5b177 e771912bf47f470d8f4a5acf2dbb0d47
msgid "**Time offset (image timestamp to log timestamp)**"
msgstr "**时间偏移（图像时间戳与日志时间戳）**"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-images-with-mission-planner.rst:30
#: 4f868b200c134ed1b57a9026621fe2d3 553ba5d590144562a52c1daaae50c6aa
#: a4bfd13c52d24b8f8d00658510975177 e6edc9552a4345a9a01d0c1ebef35f45
msgid ""
"This method uses the time difference between the camera internal clock and "
"system clock to determine where in the log each image was taken and get the "
"GPS information. Typically users must tune the offset value in order to find"
" a sensible result."
msgstr "此方法使用相机内部时钟与系统时钟的时间差来确定日志中每张图像的拍摄位置并获取 GPS 信息。通常用户需要调整偏移值以找到合理结果。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-images-with-mission-planner.rst:37
#: 84a86dfaf65c4db9aa59d4098721f0cc e420b151e133403298688f27f4a2e3f2
#: fd064f8e81684429afaaeb82097f73f9 fd27363d1fe0483f9dbdfbb1d8896baf
msgid "This method is less accurate. It is used when there is no"
msgstr "此方法精度较低。在没有以下情况时使用"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-images-with-mission-planner.rst:38
#: 3977c2e2ad7b4d23827140883cf87f47 87438abd5b3a48208461ecff0985b6c7
#: 88ddb900e7a0459ea1f20c8eee1e19c5 8f337242a7184bc6a472ae2f899b845c
msgid "connection between camera and autopilot."
msgstr "相机与飞控之间的连接。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-images-with-mission-planner.rst:42
#: 0f4c9ea6fa5345689223f36117630dd0 8fada513f8ca4142ab856f916ea7daa3
#: 94918902a83a4ce3b1d3fd35c0bd7664 e08359ed746340d8b1f7e61be2a03afa
msgid ""
"Even if your camera has a built-in GPS you *may* find this approach provide "
"more accurate information than the built-in GPS."
msgstr "即使您的相机有内置 GPS，您也 *可能* 发现此方法比内置 GPS 提供更准确的信息。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-images-with-mission-planner.rst:46
#: 1387d7d70cf749c191f5ac8e4a6510d8 1b06a7b0150e49d98e73083a4629a6d2
#: 2f298497a37d41a293c847efdbec9416 e2487960a9ab4530942b4fb1ce449285
msgid "Geotagging images"
msgstr "图像地理标记"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-images-with-mission-planner.rst:49
#: 61c8f0106309498dbdf836b173acc5fb 71fbcbd9efd24539b4f44375ae217a42
#: e8acfa608b064f428c4ce28e589c67f9 ff37148e8ded458395705da2019e75d2
msgid "Common pre-steps"
msgstr "通用前置步骤"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-images-with-mission-planner.rst:51
#: 07458a6715fb4561bd470f85b29dc783 87d733ed4dd64ee29f26fd8626ebdc9e
#: d6e812bbbc684926a65b08f9dafb3c00 f93c856a2ecc4f7cb0ba4c1ecfa914c4
msgid ""
"Open Mission Planner and press **Ctrl+F**. This will open a hidden screen "
"like the one shown below."
msgstr "打开 Mission Planner 并按 **Ctrl+F**。这将打开如下所示的隐藏界面。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-images-with-mission-planner.rst:57
#: 88df8b4c7d854827bc31be06e256b381 9e987e26b1204961b32fe00fd7893426
#: bc269241fcba49b388dd6b0f82076ed7 eaa8fedd4e824ce8bd495716a661c0cd
msgid "Mission Planner: Temp Screen (Ctrl +F)"
msgstr "Mission Planner：临时界面（Ctrl+F）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-images-with-mission-planner.rst:59
#: 0961ada126294b43b9db1a0b0fb48580 59df6da730464ff69ef62355b46dc2b1
#: a14f05d37a92474d890d9e319216bbee ffad2261b5d742158b553652acf56159
msgid ""
"Click the button **Geo ref images**. It will give you access to the *Geo "
"Tagging* tool"
msgstr "点击 **Geo ref images** 按钮。将进入 *地理标记* 工具"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-images-with-mission-planner.rst:65
#: 06f96292332f4806b00efa8db2af61c1 758b59a9151044678a030a36f0f63779
#: 8a25e3c0e52c4352af64a3a44511d7b6 d59113b2a40b4ba5b37d0313bb9cd6c2
msgid "Mission Planner: Geo Ref Images Screen"
msgstr "Mission Planner：地理参考图像界面"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-images-with-mission-planner.rst:67
#: 245cbb14cdd74582ab27e56c2b0fd9fa 36ab461a7a8c440d9bb215a53f5d72f0
#: 96c44f4d801d4854806c8de7065d4d30 c19de9218015495a904af447fdd39ebd
msgid ""
"Click the button **Browse Log** and select the log (**.tlog** or **.log)** "
"of the flight related to the shooting session."
msgstr "点击 **Browse Log** 按钮，选择与拍摄会话相关的飞行日志（**.tlog** 或 **.log**）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-images-with-mission-planner.rst:69
#: 0ace905d06f440459cdf04834c21fea9 2718d3ffbf3e43038767b6d2ee7e2acd
#: 4017cff5c4f44780ae5c9cd3735ef0e0 80ae1eea72974629bd085c0e0262b16b
msgid ""
"Click the button **Browse Directory** and select the folder where your "
"aerial pictures were downloaded from your camera."
msgstr "点击 **Browse Directory** 按钮，选择从相机下载航拍照片的文件夹。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-images-with-mission-planner.rst:72
#: 355bc70175e54c26bd3e3c32068b6234 9dee542c8dee4896b0fc4e37a58e8f5b
#: a7ff60eb11c04258916f411095e5977d e60ff61d452745e5b5b514ae8e635bd7
msgid ""
"Notice that the camera picture folder can contain other files apart from the"
" pictures. However in terms of pictures, it must contain just the ones "
"belonging to the flight."
msgstr "注意相机图片文件夹除图片外还可以包含其他文件。但就图片而言，必须只包含本次飞行的照片。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-images-with-mission-planner.rst:76
#: 5452aa1e7de3441a8fb6bcd9915098a9 5e7bc0cf95c84144a6f8835688825d9b
#: b6ce077df55b40c8a33af49c9fd31184 db4bba96d36c427abf3325f711b2e058
msgid ""
"The next steps depend on whether you're using CAM Messages or a time offset."
msgstr "后续步骤取决于您使用的是 CAM 消息还是时间偏移。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-images-with-mission-planner.rst:80
#: 363615b79dc54e1cbf0f36938c95a037 3c781dc9f20942c3b49fe0e6a15d1ea0
#: 4f6dadb4745f4c198ac34575ce88577e 5fe9a2162b934d478ff08206567152ac
msgid "CAM messages"
msgstr "CAM 消息"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-images-with-mission-planner.rst:82
#: 27e8e79a332743af95282486860327e0 30910f95452e4f8db6161b177197664a
#: 51a7073732854dd8a9c79763649f42dc d4a674af7f9d4e81b73dcb51fbd18eb1
msgid ""
"In order to process CAM messages, the mission file had to be defined to use "
"remote camera trigger by means of any of the available mission commands "
"(CAM_TRIGG_DISTANCE, DO_DIGICAM_CONTROL, etc)."
msgstr ""
"为了处理 CAM 消息，任务文件必须定义为使用任何可用任务命令（CAM_TRIGG_DISTANCE、DO_DIGICAM_CONTROL "
"等）通过遥控相机触发。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-images-with-mission-planner.rst:86
#: 2137373ddf1140e7bf6a3588a1c66efe 5f144c00c075413d8547b544c49e771b
#: 90a9cd512aeb433cbfc8320d433d4d98 ca347bf9c508432c8af4f83e0a1381ef
msgid ""
"Select the **CAM Message** method if it is not selected in the *Geotag Mode*"
" section."
msgstr "如果 *地理标记模式* 部分中未选择，请选择 **CAM Message** 方法。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-images-with-mission-planner.rst:88
#: 598f88520b034d6189cb2b7c5fcadfce 941336eed5db4242b8e29d546805d412
#: e9107bdf8d87466b811cc360d272fa0b f057f36750a241eeaf976400237b9b38
msgid ""
"Enter Shutter Lag value (in milliseconds) if you know it. If not leave it "
"with 0"
msgstr "如果知道快门延迟值（以毫秒为单位），请输入；否则保持为 0"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-images-with-mission-planner.rst:90
#: 58214dd96a024c9891e3c042f4322efb 956ba65a40884a0792a2d95249e89cca
#: ba08f75bcf994e4aa210a511c32980d1 fdc56ef7285647bf8c79adfdea1e1348
msgid ""
"Check that Log offsets are correct according to your log version (usually "
"these are OK)"
msgstr "根据您的日志版本检查日志偏移量是否正确（通常这些都是正确的）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-images-with-mission-planner.rst:92
#: b0c483e10f0b46c4bbb1c4f687aa0eb6 ba26a49e74864aea8354ff827a0c0b67
#: bda70496b95a4c50b63465f2506bdc07 c50fadd0505b48d7ab8913024ef49555
msgid "Enter FOV information if needed"
msgstr "如需要，输入 FOV 信息"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-images-with-mission-planner.rst:93
#: 2ab6adc76767495d944dcca58b7b26e4 42ecb9353f1c4fb69cb886b8580782d5
#: d51ca848d32340d29b774d04fced83e2 da77daee6d8e418cafae22148a9c7b09
msgid ""
"Select **Use AMSL Alt** checkbox if you want absolute altitude. Otherwise, "
"uncheck"
msgstr "如果需要绝对高度，勾选 **Use AMSL Alt** 复选框；否则取消勾选"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-images-with-mission-planner.rst:137
#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-images-with-mission-planner.rst:95
#: 1c36697be3e1452e9629261c254b0d6b 3e9d3261decc427cb131f1561184e810
#: 4683f97956d2492d86d226da9cd1df5e 71804e4906574a8b8f3b65637a189eae
#: b09b7986dc7749b6b5189e8ca36f23f3 b24dfaf078c74c64a91de6a350c10154
#: b95ddbf077e34021945325bd8f71b4e4 c556e025c8ff4b05a604f9fe99f36f4f
msgid "Click **Pre-process**"
msgstr "点击 **Pre-process**"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-images-with-mission-planner.rst:139
#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-images-with-mission-planner.rst:97
#: 24d911a4e1944b49a80da96a0fdbef50 46cadd66f7d047d99578142a3b8ab1fd
#: 7752a8291baa4814ae0ba644c4fef413 98882eb3aabd4603a59a857a44d4873c
#: b018be020a7549aba258777253b4a4df b0b407aed8b34e0cb65d3d2c0f7f23e4
#: d57ba25241bb483587569a9a0b6f9a58 fb592468244341d89eaa62f7301c687a
msgid ""
"If pre-processing works correctly, you will see ``Done`` displayed at the "
"end of the *Process Messages Area*."
msgstr "如果预处理正确完成，您将在 *过程消息区域* 末尾看到 ``Done``。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-images-with-mission-planner.rst:105
#: 441f704fdf064b1a8bc34ae2571407fd 8647968270634283b3a21555f66d2781
#: 98934d3a7e5941dc90a1aecc30fc68b1 a1b08c53a6c44e9b941f2154ce048c45
msgid ""
"The most common problem in this processing mode is having a discrepancy "
"between the number of CAM messages in log and the number of pictures in the "
"folder. If the tool finds that they are different, it will output an error "
"message and abort."
msgstr "此处理模式中最常见的问题是日志中的 CAM 消息数量与文件夹中的图片数量不一致。如果工具发现不同，将输出错误消息并中止。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-images-with-mission-planner.rst:110
#: 22c92c8b54584c37bea11bf99a633dd2 3e42292e19bc44a1b1a9188a56d7a7ba
#: 659a91285edf4ada93fc02ce05ffa006 ded1a5c9a6214cfb87a770c56cb247d1
msgid ""
"The final step is to \"sanity check\" the proposed picture location using "
"the **Location Kml** button (See :ref:`Common Post-steps <common-geotagging-"
"images-with-mission-planner_common_post-steps>` below)."
msgstr ""
"最后一步是使用 **Location Kml** 按钮对建议的图片位置进行「合理性检查」（见下方 :ref:`Common Post-steps "
"<common-geotagging-images-with-mission-planner_common_post-steps>`）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-images-with-mission-planner.rst:114
#: 9bd6b6bc65404a9da794ebf2d8d0c2bd a7f6a637e32c4f63ae200741621102a3
#: c8e5456194254197a6bf68e4a1af5715 d3c06b200c304108b1ecbd36a6c40fd0
msgid "Time offset"
msgstr "时间偏移"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-images-with-mission-planner.rst:118
#: 493c99e1c7364818868ebcc421756214 aef5f39270824270ba63d6db6a67a744
#: c0b14c0a586840e390c69a5cbfe809fb dc453e7e6c954e9e8ae3d29d341d0081
msgid ""
"If you haven't flown yet, one useful trick is to synchronize camera and "
"system time."
msgstr "如果尚未飞行，一个有用的技巧是同步相机和系统时间。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-images-with-mission-planner.rst:121
#: 190c0c9adfc742e49af76a713591def0 b5005126c9644bd898222b48bf281fa1
#: bc60b35318494ba6bd4f0d3dc9bd98eb dec73cac62264383bc423fefc53474ba
msgid ""
"Select the **Time Offset** method if it is not selected in the *Geotag Mode*"
" section."
msgstr "如果 *地理标记模式* 部分中未选择，请选择 **Time Offset** 方法。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-images-with-mission-planner.rst:123
#: 4c606dd7954a40f9938c9ab3efaffaf0 811d9345b3de45e4a39d023195e182c7
#: e967d405cf044e259aed7836384e5f55 fb2bab7432664be5afff0ec481684554
msgid "Click on **Estimate Offset** button"
msgstr "点击 **Estimate Offset** 按钮"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-images-with-mission-planner.rst:125
#: 02b0ab9ed2da4c3a9cb5e8585dd66b11 3bb5bb2ebff34bedb01128bfb775d397
#: 691f022d5c854b2faa2fddec49795992 8a2de23035e54054a386db8034ad5555
msgid ""
"The tool will calculate (as explained in previous section) the time "
"difference between the first picture and the first GPS time in the log."
msgstr "工具将计算（如上一节所述）第一张图片与日志中第一个 GPS 时间的时间差。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-images-with-mission-planner.rst:128
#: 444d35c856634b57ba9694d2dfaf641b 8593e0c847e840a8ab19f3b2b9e342d5
#: 967b0594fb7942c2ac2cca31a26bdccb d56e9f9595954760b0ff37a5ea716496
msgid ""
"Copy the calculated offset printed in the *Process Messages Area* and paste "
"it into the field *Seconds offset*"
msgstr "复制打印在 *过程消息区域* 中的计算偏移量，并粘贴到 *Seconds offset* 字段中"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-images-with-mission-planner.rst:131
#: 2b0ea79f9f114359b029ce44d7159f66 8fb17d4b51c54991b18c0cec54f664df
#: a0a6eb490fbd4081aa70335864bd29c3 b2d8ce1cad584ad2b1e35e457abbf934
msgid "Take a look at the following picture:"
msgstr "参考以下图片："

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-images-with-mission-planner.rst:144
#: 5097683c645e46c081b81610bff9fe6b 5f68d6cb9baf4813a088bc1d1ad56bfd
#: 7c8f4a851cce499ea7a2a02dbdf5f0a0 a0d10ec614824546be0e3e56fefe809c
msgid ""
"The most common problem when using this method is the use of an inaccurate "
"time offset. Remember that the estimated time offset is just a starting "
"point!"
msgstr "使用此方法时最常见的问题是使用了不准确的时间偏移。请记住，估算的时间偏移只是一个起点！"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-images-with-mission-planner.rst:148
#: a0dc5a36a8b141939b5155ea4784820f ad09087e55aa4803bae930a19190cfe1
#: bae08e4339d84fe7a52cb9146674c916 fa0d271168d649bcb2b76da7606c54d0
msgid ""
"The Geotag tool will output a warning if pictures are discovered that are "
"not found in the autopilot log - see picture below:"
msgstr "如果发现在飞控日志中找不到的图片，地理标记工具将输出警告——见下图："

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-images-with-mission-planner.rst:154
